torname{sin}⁡\\theta ⟩,\\,y\\in [0,1],\\,\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi ).\n$$\n\n  \n\nTherefore, the first component of $r$ is $({y}^{3}-{y}^{4})\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta .$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14071875/state.json" "file_sha256" "9005c98b808251cef6900ad9c81f5c6755ee6660c1f7a7a54bd8bee427139fdf"} {"question" "q-109773" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14071875/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "fb8d034be59ac339cfd7fb0378a92b53963025c0e6c52261f7e13601cdbbd48e"} {"question" "q-109773" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14071875/state.json" "file_sha256" "9005c98b808251cef6900ad9c81f5c6755ee6660c1f7a7a54bd8bee427139fdf"} {"question" "q-109773" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "({y}^{3}-{y}^{4})\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta "] ["math" "({y}^{4}-{y}^{3})\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta "] ["math" "2\\pi ({y}^{3}-{y}^{4})\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta "] ["math" "\\pi {y}^{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta "] ["math" "{y}^{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta "]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14071875/state.json" "file_sha256" "9005c98b808251cef6900ad9c81f5c6755ee6660c1f7a7a54bd8bee427139fdf"} {"question" "q-109773" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "({y}^{3}-{y}^{4})\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta "] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14071875/state.